      "challengedBy": [],
      "claim": "The helper’s return value changed from the parsed token payload to the full `safeParse` result object, but the changed callers still use it as if it were a token object. In `GoogleCalendarService.refreshAccessToken`, `parseRefreshTokenResponse(googleCredentials, googleCredentialSchema)` is assigned to `key` and persisted to `prisma.credential.update`, while the code also continues to read `token.access_token` and `token.expiry_date` from the `refreshOAuthTokens` result. Because the helper now returns `{ success, data }`, any caller expecting the token fields directly will no longer receive the same shape.",
